01:43:57.672 --> 01:43:58.573
<i>Frank, kumohon, bisakah kau...</i>

01:43:58.606 --> 01:43:59.507
Eh...

01:43:59.540 --> 01:44:00.742
Frank!

01:44:13.087 --> 01:44:14.021
Cek jarak?

01:44:14.055 --> 01:44:15.656
12 meter, aman.

01:44:15.690 --> 01:44:17.058
Mengunci ruangan.

01:44:17.091 --> 01:44:17.992
Mengunci.

01:44:23.497 --> 01:44:24.498
<i>Nonaktifkan inhibitor.</i>

01:44:28.736 --> 01:44:31.304
<i>Jean, kekuatamu sekarang beroperasi sepenuhnya.</i>

01:44:40.715 --> 01:44:41.682
<i>Seperti kau tahu,</i>

01:44:41.716 --> 01:44:44.051
<i>kami di luar radius lompatanmu.</i>

01:44:44.085 --> 01:44:47.454
