01:46:02.797 --> 01:46:05.432
Katakan apa itu V-Max.

01:46:05.465 --> 01:46:06.968
Aku tahu di situlah kau menyembunyikan dia.

01:46:22.149 --> 01:46:23.184
Dia melompat.

01:46:25.586 --> 01:46:26.988
Dimengerti.

01:46:27.021 --> 01:46:30.057
Kita kondisi karantina penuh.
Proses telah dimulai.

01:46:30.091 --> 01:46:31.092
Proses apa?

01:46:32.660 --> 01:46:35.796
Hey, whoa,
kelihatannya di situ cukup serius, bro.

01:46:35.830 --> 01:46:37.497
Hey, hey, whoa! Kenapa kalian?

01:46:37.531 --> 01:46:38.699
