01:52:31.218 --> 01:52:32.253
Ini dia.

01:52:46.834 --> 01:52:48.202
Ya Tuhan, itu keren banget.

01:53:03.551 --> 01:53:05.052
Ow! Ow!

01:53:09.256 --> 01:53:11.292
Jean! Jean, kumohon!

01:53:25.540 --> 01:53:27.308
Ayo! Ayo! Ayo!

01:53:48.062 --> 01:53:49.163
Apa yang...

01:53:51.031 --> 01:53:52.066
