02:03:08.089 --> 02:03:09.156
Hey.

02:03:24.939 --> 02:03:26.574
Turut prihatin soal kakakmu.

02:03:31.812 --> 02:03:33.648
Aku turut prihatin soal bibimu.

02:03:37.018 --> 02:03:38.219
Yeah, kau pasti akan menyukai dia.

02:03:42.089 --> 02:03:44.025
